  "description": "MICQUN crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H74 Dy4 N6 O20,4(C5 H5 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.589-3.937 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.86-111.90°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L)4(acac)2(OH)2(H2O)2(C6H5N)4]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
